{% comment %}
  06 de 12 · RAZÓN #4 · RUTINA + COMPARATIVA
  Imágenes en Contenido > Archivos: bronzer-rutina.jpg (1600x2000, vertical 4:5) · bronzer-producto.jpg (la misma de la sección 08)
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  .bz-vs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:8px}
  .bz-vs-col{border-radius:20px;padding:16px 14px;background:var(--bz-white);border:1px solid var(--bz-line)}
  .bz-vs-col.is-win{border:2px solid var(--bz-coral);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,var(--bz-p1) 100%);box-shadow:0 20px 40px -26px rgba(198,95,69,.55)}
  .bz-vs-h{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;min-height:44px;margin-bottom:8px;font-weight:700;color:var(--bz-brown);font-size:14px;line-height:1.2}
  .bz-vs-h img{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;object-fit:cover;background:var(--bz-p2)}
  .bz-vs-h .bz-vs-x{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:10px;background:#F2ECE9;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#A9A09A;font-size:18px}
  .bz-vs ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
  .bz-vs li{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--bz-line);font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.3}
  .bz-vs li svg{flex:0 0 16px;width:16px;height:16px;margin-top:1px}
  .bz-vs-col:not(.is-win) li{color:var(--bz-muted)}
  .bz-vs-col.is-win li{color:var(--bz-brown);font-weight:600}
  @media(min-width:750px){.bz-vs{gap:14px}.bz-vs-col{padding:20px}.bz-vs li{font-size:15px}}
</style>

<div class="bz">
  <section class="bz-sec" id="razon-4">
    <div class="bz-wrap">
      <div class="bz-rz">
        <div class="bz-rz-head">
          <div class="bz-rz-num"><b>04</b><span class="bz-eyebrow">Razón 4 · Rutina</span></div>
          <h2>Mantener el dorado pasa a ser tan simple como tomar <em>una cápsula.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="bz-rz-media">
          <div class="bz-media bz-ar-45">
            <img src="{{ 'bronzer-rutina.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Desayuno con mate y DR WOMAN Bronzer" width="1600" height="2000" loading="lazy" onerror="this.parentNode.classList.add('is-empty');this.remove()">
            <span class="bz-media-ph">bronzer-rutina.jpg</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bz-rz-text">
          <p>Con el autobronceante vivís pendiente: exfoliar, aplicar, esperar que seque, no transpirar, retocar cada tres días.</p>
          <p>Con Bronzer es <strong>una cápsula por día con el desayuno (o con el mate).</strong> Sin guantes, sin olor, sin manchar nada. La tomás de forma constante y el tono se va construyendo solo.</p>

          <div class="bz-vs">
            <div class="bz-vs-col">
              <div class="bz-vs-h"><span class="bz-vs-x">✕</span>Autobronceante</div>
              <ul>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" stroke="#B8AAA2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"/></svg>1 a 2 horas por semana</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" stroke="#B8AAA2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"/></svg>Manchas y vetas</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" stroke="#B8AAA2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"/></svg>Tiñe ropa y sábanas</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" stroke="#B8AAA2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"/></svg>Olor característico</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" stroke="#B8AAA2" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8"/></svg>Se va en parches</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="bz-vs-col is-win">
              <div class="bz-vs-h"><img src="{{ 'bronzer-producto.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="" width="40" height="40" loading="lazy">DR WOMAN Bronzer</div>
              <ul>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#E0765A" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3L13 4.5"/></svg>10 segundos por día</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#E0765A" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3L13 4.5"/></svg>Tono gradual y parejo</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#E0765A" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3L13 4.5"/></svg>No mancha nada</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#E0765A" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3L13 4.5"/></svg>Sin olor</li>
                <li><svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#E0765A" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3L13 4.5"/></svg>Con uso constante</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
